# Pulsar Start — operator gate, begin extrusion.
#
# Paste after the initial home movej, BEFORE the first print move.
# The temperature wait already happened in Pulsar Setup (pulsar_preheat
# blocks). The popup here is the final "I've checked the machine"
# operator gate before the screw starts turning.

popup("Press Ready to start your print", title="Operator_Safety", warning=False, error=False, blocking=True)

pulsar_start_extrusion(900, 100)
